WEBVTT

00:00:02.286 --> 00:00:03.326
UH, HAGRID,
WHAT EXACTLY IS THAT?

00:00:03.370 --> 00:00:06.460
THAT? IT'S A--
IT'S, UM--

00:00:06.503 --> 00:00:08.766
I KNOW WHAT THAT IS!

00:00:08.810 --> 00:00:11.639
BUT, HAGRID,
HOW DID YOU GET ONE?

00:00:11.682 --> 00:00:12.814
I WON IT...

00:00:12.857 --> 00:00:14.946
OFF A STRANGER
I MET DOWN AT THE PUB.

00:00:14.990 --> 00:00:16.644
SEEMED QUITE GLAD
TO BE RID OF IT,

00:00:16.687 --> 00:00:18.341
AS A MATTER OF FACT.

00:00:18.385 --> 00:00:21.518
[CRACKING]

00:00:38.056 --> 00:00:41.233
[DRAGON SCREECHES]

00:00:41.277 --> 00:00:44.585
IS THAT...

00:00:44.628 --> 00:00:46.151
A DRAGON?

00:00:46.195 --> 00:00:47.588
THAT'S NOT
JUST A DRAGON.

00:00:47.631 --> 00:00:49.720
THAT'S A NORWEGIAN
RIDGEBACK.

00:00:49.764 --> 00:00:52.419
MY BROTHER CHARLIE
WORKS WITH THESE

00:00:52.462 --> 00:00:53.768
IN ROMANIA.

00:00:53.811 --> 00:00:55.334
ISN'T HE BEAUTIFUL?

00:00:55.378 --> 00:00:57.380
OH, BLESS HIM.
LOOK, HE KNOWS HIS MUMMY.

00:00:57.424 --> 00:00:59.077
[CHUCKLES]

00:00:59.121 --> 00:01:00.122
HELLO, NORBERT.

00:01:00.165 --> 00:01:01.166
[SQUEALS]

00:01:01.210 --> 00:01:02.907
NORBERT?

00:01:02.951 --> 00:01:04.735
YEAH, WELL, HE'S GOT
TO HAVE A NAME, DOESN'T HE?

00:01:06.345 --> 00:01:07.477
DON'T YOU, NORBERT?

00:01:07.521 --> 00:01:09.740
EH? DEE-DEE-DEE!

00:01:09.784 --> 00:01:10.828
[HICCUPS]

00:01:10.872 --> 00:01:12.613
OOH!

00:01:12.656 --> 00:01:13.744
OOH, OOH, OOH!

00:01:13.788 --> 00:01:15.485
OOH! WELL...

00:01:15.529 --> 00:01:17.487
HE'LL HAVE TO BE
TRAINED UP A BIT, OF COURSE.

00:01:20.490 --> 00:01:22.666
[SCREECHES]

00:01:22.710 --> 00:01:23.928
WHO'S THAT?

00:01:26.496 --> 00:01:27.671
MALFOY.

00:01:29.543 --> 00:01:30.979
OH, DEAR.

00:01:31.022 --> 00:01:32.546
[SCREECHES]

00:01:32.589 --> 00:01:34.635
Harry: HAGRID ALWAYS
WANTED A DRAGON.

00:01:34.678 --> 00:01:37.507
TOLD ME SO THE FIRST TIME
I EVER MET HIM.

00:01:37.551 --> 00:01:39.422
Ron: IT'S CRAZY.

00:01:39.466 --> 00:01:41.816
AND WORSE, MALFOY KNOWS.

00:01:41.859 --> 00:01:42.991
Harry: I DON'T
UNDERSTAND.

00:01:43.034 --> 00:01:43.992
IS THAT BAD?

00:01:44.035 --> 00:01:46.037
IT'S BAD.

00:01:46.081 --> 00:01:47.735
GOOD EVENING.

00:01:51.260 --> 00:01:54.916
NOTHING,
I REPEAT, NOTHING

00:01:54.959 --> 00:01:56.787
GIVES A STUDENT THE RIGHT

00:01:56.831 --> 00:01:58.876
TO WALK ABOUT
THE SCHOOL AT NIGHT.

00:01:58.920 --> 00:02:02.053
THEREFORE, AS PUNISHMENT
FOR YOUR ACTIONS,

00:02:02.097 --> 00:02:03.707
50 POINTS WILL BE TAKEN.

00:02:03.751 --> 00:02:05.274
50?

00:02:05.317 --> 00:02:06.536
EACH.

00:02:06.580 --> 00:02:09.931
AND TO ENSURE IT
DOESN'T HAPPEN AGAIN,

00:02:09.974 --> 00:02:14.239
ALL FOUR OF YOU
WILL RECEIVE DETENTION.

00:02:14.283 --> 00:02:15.589
EXCUSE ME, PROFESSOR.

00:02:15.632 --> 00:02:17.155
PERHAPS I HEARD YOU WRONG.

00:02:17.199 --> 00:02:18.983
I THOUGHT YOU SAID
THE FOUR OF US.

00:02:19.027 --> 00:02:22.465
NO, YOU HEARD ME
CORRECTLY, MR. MALFOY.

00:02:22.509 --> 00:02:24.554
YOU SEE, HONORABLE
AS YOUR INTENTIONS WERE,

00:02:24.598 --> 00:02:27.818
YOU TOO WERE OUT
OF BED AFTER HOURS.

00:02:27.862 --> 00:02:29.864
YOU WILL JOIN
YOUR CLASSMATES

00:02:29.907 --> 00:02:31.256
IN DETENTION.

00:02:42.050 --> 00:02:46.533
A PITY THEY LET
THE OLD PUNISHMENTS DIE.

00:02:46.576 --> 00:02:48.099
THERE WAS A TIME
DETENTION WOULD FIND YOU

00:02:48.143 --> 00:02:51.407
HANGING BY YOUR THUMBS
IN THE DUNGEONS.

00:02:51.450 --> 00:02:54.453
GOD, I MISS
THE SCREAMING.

00:02:57.021 --> 00:02:57.794
YOU'LL BE SERVING DETENTION
WITH HAGRID TONIGHT.
